# Alert

Alerts communicate a short, contextual state through one component and a small set of props.

Destructive alerts use the assertive `alert` role; other variants use the polite `status` role. Titles render as neutral text by default. Set `titleElement="h3"` only when the title belongs in the page heading hierarchy.

Use the optional `action` snippet for a compact button or link. Keep the action short and directly related to the message.

